        <skos:definition rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A continuant is target of a planned process if the continuant is a participant in the process and it in important part of towards the main objective of the process&apos; plan. [Allotrope]</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">target of</skos:prefLabel>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


