        <skos:altLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">applied in</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">used in</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:definition rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A continuant is selected or used in planned process if the participant is chosen to influence the process towards some objective but is itself not essentially changed by a process. [Allotrope]</skos:definition>
