        <skos:definition rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">To calibrate is a function to establish, under specified conditions, the relationship between values of quantities indicated by a measuring instrument, or measuring system, or values represented by a material measure or a reference material, and the corresponding values realized by standards. [IUPAC]</skos:definition>
