        <skos:definition rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">To compare is a function to observe or assess the similarities or dissimilarities between two things. [Allotrope]</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">to compare</skos:prefLabel>
