        <skos:definition rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Focused beam reflectance measurement is a measuring process using a focused laser beam at a fixed speed of rotation to calculate particle chord lengths via detection of the backscattered light pulses. [Allotrope]</skos:definition>
