        <skos:definition rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A selected-ion monitoring (SIM) chromatogram is similar to an XIC, with the exception that the mass spectrometer is operated in SIM mode, such that only preselected m/z values are detected in the analysis. [Wikipedia]</skos:definition>
