        <skos:example rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">In Raman spectroscopy a trend a result based on a collection of spectra. [Allotrope]</skos:example>
        <skos:example rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">In infrared spectroscopy the intensities of peaks over time can be used to monitor compound concentration increase/decrease of a chemical reaction over time.</skos:example>
