        <skos:definition rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The difference between two discrete points next to each other in a range of discrete values. [Allotrope]</skos:definition>
        <skos:example rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A device property can be set between a minimum and maximum value but only in steps of the increment value. [Allotrope]</skos:example>
