        <skos:definition rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A scalar is an element of a field which is used to define a vector space. [Wikipedia]</skos:definition>
        <skos:editorialNote rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">review of definition needed</skos:editorialNote>
