        <skos:definition rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">An extrapolated moisture content is a prediction about the moisture content percentage of a material entity based on results of a partial drying process. [Allotrope]</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">extrapolated moisture content</skos:prefLabel>
