        <skos:definition rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Pause time is a mass spectrometry system setting that specifies the time in between different ms event&apos;s measurement time to allow the instrument to equilibrate. [Allotrope]</skos:definition>
