        <skos:definition rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A default condition is a condition that is member of a set of conditions that is always true if all others conditions in the collections are false. [Allotrope]</skos:definition>
        <skos:example rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A default value in a conditional parameter specification. [Allotrope]</skos:example>
