        <skos:scopeNote rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Experimental data identifier is different from experiment identifier. The first identifies the data about the experiment, the later the experiment itself. There can be many experimental data about the same experiment. [Allotrope]</skos:scopeNote>
