        <skos:definition rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A chromatography column chemistry type is a classification datum that classifies a chromatography column by the stationary phase and/or chromatographic packing used. [Allotrope]</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">chromatography column chemistry type</skos:prefLabel>
