        <skos:definition rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The expiry time prescription is a prescription about a material or information content entity that prescribes until what time it is allowed to be used for the stated purpose. [Allotrope]</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">expiry time prescription</skos:prefLabel>
