        <skos:definition rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A database is an organized collection of data, generally stored and accessed electronically from a computer system. Where databases are more complex they are often developed using formal design and modeling techniques. [Wikipedia]</skos:definition>
