        <skos:definition rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The enthalpy of vaporization datum is quantification of the amount of energy (enthalpy) that must be added to a liquid substance, to transform a quantity of that substance into a gas. [Wikipedia]</skos:definition>
