        <skos:definition rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A laser rotation speed setting is a control setting that specifies the angular velocity of the laser in a FBRM run over time. [Allotrope]</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">laser rotation speed setting</skos:prefLabel>
