        <skos:definition rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A fluorescence excitation spectrum is a spectrum that plots the intensity of fluorescence of a material entity vs the excitation wavelength at a defined emission wavelength. [Allotrope]</skos:definition>
