        <skos:definition rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A fluorescence emission spectrum is a spectrum that plots the intensity of fluorescence of a material entity vs the emission wavelength at a defined excitation wavelength. [Allotrope]</skos:definition>
