        <skos:definition rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A sample introduction medium designates the material type that is used as medium (role) in a sample introduction process in a measurement. [Allotrope]</skos:definition>
        <skos:example rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Acetonitrile as the solvent in liquid chromatography, or nitrogen as the carrier gas in gas chromatography.</skos:example>
