        <skos:definition rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A half height multiplier resolution setting (USP) is a data processing setting that indicates at which peak height the USP resolution should be calculated. [Allotrope]</skos:definition>
        <skos:prefLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">half height multiplier resolution setting (USP)</skos:prefLabel>
