        <skos:definition rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A baseline noise minimum runtime percentage setting is a data processing setting that indicates the minimal duration for calculating the baseline noise as a percentage of the run time. [Allotrope]</skos:definition>
