        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Every process boundary occupies_temporal_region a zero-dimensional temporal region. (axiom label in BFO2 Reference: [085-002])</owl:annotatedTarget>
