        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A dicarboximide that is 4-(2-hydroxyethyl)piperidine-2,6-dione in which one of the hydrogens attached to the carbon  bearing the hydroxy group is replaced by a 3,5-dimethyl-2-oxocyclohexyl group. It is an antibiotic produced by the bacterium Streptomyces griseus.</obo:IAO_0000115>
