        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">An  organic molecule that is electrically neutral carrying a positive and a negative charge in one of its major canonical descriptions. In most dipolar compounds the charges are delocalized; however the term is also applied to species where this is not the case.</obo:IAO_0000115>
